    "updated_at": "2025-12-24T20:04:29Z",
    "body": "Turns out that this patch is wrong, see tests in https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/56921\r\n\r\nInstead, the request referrer should use https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#api-base-url instead of creation URL, as that's what browsers actually do. That also makes a lot more sense to me.",
