    "created_at": "2025-12-27T03:45:20Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-12-27T03:45:20Z",
    "body": "> Instead, the request referrer should use https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#api-base-url instead of creation URL, as that's what browsers actually do. That also makes a lot more sense to me.\r\n\r\nSee https://github.com/w3c/webappsec-referrer-policy/pull/177#issuecomment-3693626052 for why I don't think we can do that. I think the direction of this PR might be right after all.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
