    "created_at": "2025-12-27T09:41:50Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-12-27T09:41:50Z",
    "body": "Other specifications such as the reporting API rely on the creation URL being the URL prior to redirects. See step 2 of https://w3c.github.io/reporting/#generate-a-report That's what https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/56921 confirms is the existing behavior in browsers.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
