    "updated_at": "2025-12-29T18:57:21Z",
    "body": "I think this PR is in the right direction. But please restore the PR template and fill everything necessary out, including a link to any tests that you write, and ideally even those whose expectations might change due to this PR.\r\n\r\nIt would be great to know if any engines currently rely on the state of things before this PR, or if this PR is simply fixing a spec bug that engines don't have. I assume the latter.",
